Jm_vs3Xe0oFE83sivqM_hJmG3FLpAkrJ0CoU_ckL1rIw&oe=6AA02644"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "467916352871409", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_467916356204742_1871921057092171900_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pwxF88PNXooQ7kNvwEQYsHp&_nc_oc=AdpEfYQ1IhhPwjhL00v4RevswJ3yhp0VY3QCqO7jqghhUrLokMw0zlWnyY0qvP7ATYQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIXIW64GKXlEPFE-Kem8zdUulcrImarDVrn1cAIhFi2dg&oe=6AA00AE2"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kyFT6yv8oaMQ7kNvwGzETx8&_nc_oc=AdrAn2fpXXuwxM_zj9LqG7umlq2L0n1d-5OGpdV_O566DZoycf22pxgvVLXPJifIPQc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKtDdWAwWoa9703qhs8fSjmAG18L2Vc4s0Uf3uA-WULxA&oe=6AA02D33"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ptFLZBBesRoQ7kNvwHPN63k&_nc_oc=AdobKjxRV-v5CH9wUy7QrdoZ_ik5ZtXsIqVFtgCXKg2HDAQusCWwBN-9AzYi--7PxSA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIhXsleHBY2PvRTNrakUc8uIVJ9a6Iz6FvuLpzZBTIe_A&oe=6AA02C2F"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=77k6yN2RitIQ7kNvwEmt4Vm&_nc_oc=AdrjXhNlqXUzTUjdiJs90KWtm0F_e5nPeVFKRB6dbC6vW8sW64OB-z4pt0RfiK2NVq0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKaOyef9HYT8cw97wxLXzWVTwvlVVwWsUMbP4UN59dcMw&oe=6AA02825"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-2ImqKDqwOoQ7kNvwF-EcrX&_nc_oc=AdqGxDr_HZ0XoB8FVjpH7K5PY2t1F8-dqCi5EevsWdGiRSMJjbsfELUK-uvVl-JzIlw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJw6GfKeWN3sfgPxSJ-T7-ISdtZ-BnyRC80mKlG_QVyOA&oe=6AA0270D"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f-ZAOiB4PacQ7kNvwEdENBh&_nc_oc=AdoSbFMHnleMWmbccppHJNZ8g3defS0ejquhfYFa1mljXf5K71vWL7CYyVBSzoKlSns&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=